Runtime flow:

Program
   |
PaymentFactory.CreatePayment()
   |
Creates CryptoPayment object
   |
Payment reference points to CryptoPayment
   |
ExecutePayment()
   |
validateAmount()
   |
CryptoPayment.ProcessPayment()*/
